 "name_en": "Lease-Out Accounting (21Q)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Lease-Out Accounting (21Q)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob749ddde021e4a6b98d4cb2a7481b2d7\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob749ddde021e4a6b98d4cb2a7481b2d7__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Lease contracts describe contractual agreements between two partners: the lessor and the lessee. The lessor owns an asset, whereas the lessee has a right to use this asset during the period agreed in the lease contract. The lessee pays lease payments for the use of the asset, as agreed upon in the lease contract.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item helps you standardize and automate your lease-out debit contract management activities for real estate, as well as for machinery, equipment, vehicles, and computer hardware.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can easily create new contracts and execute periodic postings for existing contracts.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can change the customer of an existing contract, as well as run a report of existing contracts as part of your daily business.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Leveraging the reporting functions helps you to make better and more informed lease management decisions.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item is applicable for operating lease of Lease Out scenarios.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob749ddde021e4a6b98d4cb2a7481b2d7__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loiob749ddde021e4a6b98d4cb2a7481b2d7__ul_vm5_cr3_w1c\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create lease-out contract and add valuation rule</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform period posting for lease-out contract and adjustment (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Terminate lease-out contract</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute reports for Contract Management, Accounting and Adjustments</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob749ddde021e4a6b98d4cb2a7481b2d7__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Accelerate leasing processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Standardize and automate your recurring lease administration activities</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Gain full control and visibility of leases and critical dates</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor critical dates on your leases, such as lease notifications and renewals</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve decision making</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensure compliance with the latest financial reporting standards, such as the new lease accounting standards IFRS 16 and FASB ASC 842</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>租出会计 (21Q)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob749ddde021e4a6b98d4cb2a7481b2d7\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob749ddde021e4a6b98d4cb2a7481b2d7__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">租赁合同描述了出租人和承租人两个合作伙伴之间的合同协议。出租人拥有资产，而承租人有权在租赁合同约定的期间内使用此资产。承租人按照租赁合同中的约定，为资产的使用支付租赁费。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目有助于标准化和自动化您的不动产以及机械、设备、车辆和计算机硬件的租出借方合同管理活动。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">您可以轻松创建新合同并为现有合同执行定期过账。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">您可以更改现有合同的客户，并在日常业务中运行现有合同的报表。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">利用报告功能可帮助您做出更好、更明智的租赁管理决策。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目适用于租赁场景的经营租赁。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob749ddde021e4a6b98d4cb2a7481b2d7__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loiob749ddde021e4a6b98d4cb2a7481b2d7__ul_vm5_cr3_w1c\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建租出合同并添加评估规则</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行租出合同的期间过账和调整（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">终止租出合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行合同管理、会计核算和调整报表</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob749ddde021e4a6b98d4cb2a7481b2d7__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">加速租赁流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">标准化和自动化周期性租赁管理活动</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">获得租赁和关键日期的完全控制和可见性。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控租赁的关键日期，例如租赁通知和续订</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">改进决策制定</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确保符合最新的财务报告标准，例如新的租赁会计标准 IFRS 16 和 FASB ASC 842</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
